{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/9dbae04c0438165391cf25587024249c.poster.avif?t=1757180794\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/9dbae04c0438165391cf25587024249c.webm?t=1757180794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/9dbae04c0438165391cf25587024249c.mp4?t=1757180794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oneirophobia is a psychological horror game with survival elements.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will learn the story of a young man who lives far from civilization and suffers from oneirophobia (fear of dreams).</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help the main character overcome his fears by experiencing a variety of mythical dreams.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add this game to your wishlist so you don't miss its release !</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/f36bade7a7a61742760b25bd77ef11cf.poster.avif?t=1757180794\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/f36bade7a7a61742760b25bd77ef11cf.webm?t=1757180794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/f36bade7a7a61742760b25bd77ef11cf.mp4?t=1757180794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story revolves around a 19-year-old guy named Mike Sanders, who suffers from oneirophobia and post-traumatic stress disorder, acquired due to the loss of his parents at the age of 14.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mike lives on a large ranch that he inherited from his parents. Mike's ranch is located in the middle of the Routewood forest.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mike does not live alone, but with his guard dog named Marty.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mike constantly has nightmares, and sometimes he cannot distinguish between dreams and reality.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>During the game, you will visit a large number of mythical dreams, such as an abandoned city, a gloomy forest, or deserted buildings.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the role of a person suffering from fear of dreams, going through all the terrible trials that our subconscious presents us with.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/9040f917b79f83622ed699f80ec4d21f.poster.avif?t=1757180794\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/9040f917b79f83622ed699f80ec4d21f.webm?t=1757180794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/9040f917b79f83622ed699f80ec4d21f.mp4?t=1757180794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>This game has many features, both gameplay and technical.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Main gameplay features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive cutscenes.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive dialogues.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various interactions with surrounding objects.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic audio-visual accompaniment.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many interesting mechanics related to puzzles and exploring various locations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main technical features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimized graphics.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive controls.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptation for large TVs and ultrawide monitors.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The ability to flexibly customize the mouse or gamepad, sound, image, subtitles, and many other parameters.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support for various technologies, which are described in more detail in the next section.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/9f0f61e1bf62cf6d72e8fb940c89b849.poster.avif?t=1757180794\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/9f0f61e1bf62cf6d72e8fb940c89b849.webm?t=1757180794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/9f0f61e1bf62cf6d72e8fb940c89b849.mp4?t=1757180794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are many interesting technologies and supported features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Motion Matching Support (realistic animations).</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AMD FSR and NVIDIA DLSS Support.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UlltraWide Support (21:9, 32:9).</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HDR  Support\u00a0(High Dynamic Range).</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xbox controllers\u00a0Support (Bluetooth and USB).</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xbox controller vibration Support.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NVIDIA Reflex and AMD Anti-Lag\u00a0Support.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic sound processing \u201cSound Occlusion\u201d\u00a0Support.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Cloud Support.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam achievements\u00a0Support.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Family Sharing Support.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer comments Support.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/c31409c0ee5b69b54018c08727eb58af.poster.avif?t=1757180794\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/c31409c0ee5b69b54018c08727eb58af.webm?t=1757180794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/c31409c0ee5b69b54018c08727eb58af.mp4?t=1757180794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the music:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The music will resemble that of classic horror movies, setting a tense atmosphere or what is known as \u201cprimal fear.\u201d</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will also hear other styles of music, such as traditional orchestra or ambient.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This soundtrack will be sold separately and will be released at the same time as the game.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/extras/f828b2ffd540239d58dd7f6accff5c10.avif?t=1757180794\" width=800 height=333 /></span><strong>About development: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game, as well as its soundtrack, is entirely created by solo developer 1FOREVERS.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please do not consider this game as a high-budget professional project. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is developed on the Unreal Engine 5.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>! Artificial intelligence is not used in the creation of the game and its soundtrack !</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712480?t=1757180794","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/20b27da4db870f37dd64689c8c5b60568b8d272f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757180794","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/598ef78da7e4de267ea90b85d7c3c8a6ea273f7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757180794","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712480/598ef78da7e4de267ea90b85d7c3c8a6ea273f7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757180794","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable 